      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article represents results of studies concerning biochemical features of inflammation in various types of bronchial asthma caused by nonferrous metal aerosols. Also parameters of \"proteolysis--antiproteolysis\" system were studied on molecular genetic and biochemical levels, with determining serine proteinase, level of protease alpha-1 inhibitor and its hyposecretory deficit variants, levels of individual proteins."},
